00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:14,200
Related to the use it or lose it law is the keep moving principle.

88
00:08:14,880 --> 00:08:17,240
We learn about stagnation from nature.

89
00:08:17,900 --> 00:08:20,260
A river that stops moving gets smelly.

90
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:26,060
The same thing happens to people who stop moving either mentally or physically.

91
00:08:26,060 --> 00:08:32,000
Those who play contact sports know that the player who usually gets hurt the most is

92
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:33,780
the one who is standing still.

93
00:08:34,340 --> 00:08:39,240
Of course you'll need some time to catch your breath every so often but the

94
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:43,940
essential message is keep moving, extending and learning.

95
00:08:44,900 --> 00:08:50,250
Ships last a lot longer when they go to sea than when they stay in the harbour.

96
00:08:50,250 --> 00:08:52,750
The same is true for airplanes.

97
00:08:53,270 --> 00:08:56,010
don't preserve an airplane by keeping it on the ground.

98
00:08:56,570 --> 00:08:59,170
You preserve it by keeping it in service.

99
00:08:59,830 --> 00:09:04,390
We also get to live a long healthy life by staying in service.

100
00:09:05,270 --> 00:09:11,630
Longevity statistics reveal that the average person doesn't last very long after

101
00:09:11,630 --> 00:09:15,390
retirement. The moral here is don't retire.

102
00:09:16,090 --> 00:09:22,830
If a fellow says I'm 94 years old and I've worked all my life, we need to realize

103
00:09:22,830 --> 00:09:27,510
that is how we got to be 94 by staying involved.

104
00:09:28,510 --> 00:09:33,370
George Bernard Shaw won a Nobel Prize when he was nearly 70.

105
00:09:34,170 --> 00:09:38,710
Benjamin Franklin produced some of his best writings at the age of 84.

106
00:09:38,710 --> 00:09:44,970
And Pablo Picasso put brush to canvas right through his 80s.

107
00:09:45,270 --> 00:09:47,550
Isn't the issue how old we think we are?

108
00:09:48,410 --> 00:09:53,790
A bonus with the keep moving principle is that while we keep moving, we don't have a

109
00:09:53,790 --> 00:09:55,010
chance to worry.

110
00:09:55,130 --> 00:09:59,090
Hence we avoid the dreaded paralysis by analysis.

