00:15:02,570 --> 00:15:08,690
Dating from as far back as the 12th century, they are claimed to be rarest historic

153
00:15:08,690 --> 00:15:10,570
buildings in Western Europe.

154
00:15:11,350 --> 00:15:16,270
These buildings offer vital insights into Scandinavia's Viking past.

155
00:15:16,670 --> 00:15:22,310
But now, with only 30 wooden churches remaining and their condition deteriorating,

156
00:15:23,230 --> 00:15:27,710
experts are working to preserve the structures for future generations.

157
00:15:27,710 --> 00:15:33,870
Some of these spectacular churches are no more than small buildings, barely four

158
00:15:33,870 --> 00:15:36,670
