224
00:21:43,070 --> 00:21:48,910
adult observers were able to reliably discern an assortment of emotions on the

225
00:21:48,910 --> 00:21:57,190
babies' faces. These emotions included interest, joy, surprise, sadness, anger,

226
00:21:57,510 --> 00:22:00,430
disgust, contempt, and fear.

